# Comprehensive Enhancement: Full Telemetry Capture, Real-Time Enforcement & API Hardening

Overhaul the eBPF-ML security pipeline to achieve **total OS-level visibility**, **instant real-time blocking/unblocking**, and **production-grade API endpoints** — platform-agnostic for bare-metal, VMs, and containers.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This plan touches every layer — kernel eBPF probes, Go agent, Python ML engine, REST API, and storage. It is a significant change set. Please review each component and confirm before execution.

> [!WARNING]
