### Component 3: Enhanced REST API Endpoints

The current FastAPI routes are functional but limited. Add full CRUD coverage and new diagnostic endpoints.

#### [MODIFY] [routes.py](file:///home/proffaro/Documents/major-p1-v1/ml_engine/api/routes.py)

Add the following new endpoints:

| Method | Path | Purpose |
|--------|------|---------|
| `POST` | `/api/v1/blocks/pid` | **Manual PID block** — analyst can block any PID from the dashboard |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/blocks/ip` | **Manual IP block** — analyst can block any IP from the dashboard |
| `DELETE` | `/api/v1/blocks/ip` | **Unblock IP** — remove IP from kernel eBPF map |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/events/stream` | **SSE live event stream** — Server-Sent Events for dashboard real-time feed |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/events/stats` | **Event type breakdown** — counts per event type (SYSCALL, EXEC, FILE, NET, etc.) |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/system/status` | **Full system health** — Go agent status, ML model status, DB connectivity, uptime |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/kernel/blocklist` | **Direct kernel map query** — proxy to Go agent `/api/blocklist` for kernel-level truth |

#### [MODIFY] [models.py](file:///home/proffaro/Documents/major-p1-v1/ml_engine/storage/models.py)

- Add `BlockPIDRequest`, `BlockIPRequest`, `UnblockIPRequest` Pydantic DTOs.
- Add `SystemStatusResponse` DTO with fields for Go agent connectivity, model loaded status, DB health, uptime, and EPS throughput.
- Add `EventStatsResponse` DTO with per-event-type counters.

